  dialogue:
  - speakerName: Tutorial Terrence
    text: This is your <color=#79D2DB>Energy.</color> You can see your energy in
      the top left of your screen.
  - speakerName: Tutorial Terrence
    text: Placing towers will cost a set <color=#79D2DB>Energy</color> amount for
      each tower.
  - speakerName: Tutorial Terrence
    text: 'Open up the tower placement menu by pressing <b>T</b>. Click on a tower
      then click on the map to place it down.

'
  - speakerName: Tutorial Terrence
    text: 'The first wave will start once you place down your first tower, so get
      ready!

'
